Then as I said elsewhere it's not a "law" problem, it's a "law enforcement" problem. Maybe VA law didn't compel him to surrender his firearms but it's against federal law for a person convicted of domestic violence to have a firearm so someone should have contacted the feds and told them to enforce the law.

